#
# omx-contract's contract directory (docs/contract-dir.md) for the spec of a package that installs into it: the one
# directory an owner package and a domain sit in, with no schema-major level (owner ruling 2026-11-25), so a
# -contract subpackage's %files names
#   %{omx_contract_dir}/<owner>/      a package (install-contract-dir.sh <package> ... or --owner)
#   %{omx_contract_dir}/<domain>/     a domain (install-contract-dir.sh --domain)
# and a package and the domain of its name share one line. Installed by omx-contract-devel; the same directory is
# pkg-config's contractdir variable of omx-contract.pc.
%omx_contract_dir %{_datadir}/omx-contract/contract.d
